  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">1. 책을 읽고&#160;<br>게시판에 기억을 넘어 기록으로 남기고자<br>좋은 구절을 키보드로 또깍또깍 정리하고 있었습니다.</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 80.0742%;\" border=\"1\" data-ke-style=\"style0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 30.9406%; text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/839a96b0950e3fa927d4451eafef7fbeccb6b9a1\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"217\" height=\"238\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/839a96b0950e3fa927d4451eafef7fbeccb6b9a1\" data-origin-width=\"324\" data-origin-height=\"356\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 49.1337%; text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b73ba83ce062f41d819f603385e4609fc22b67f8\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"371\" height=\"302\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b73ba83ce062f41d819f603385e4609fc22b67f8\" data-origin-width=\"511\" data-origin-height=\"416\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>2. 최근에는&#160;<br>&#160;카톡 AI인 AskUp을 이용하여&#160;<br>&#160;정리하고 싶은 페이지를 사진 찍고&#160;<br>텍스트로 변환한 후 복붙하여 게시물로 만들고 있습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ec30c36f7e4ab2e19d350b02c20f12410daa3f94\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ec30c36f7e4ab2e19d350b02c20f12410daa3f94\" data-origin-width=\"1037\" data-origin-height=\"519\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\">이 장문의 텍스트를 음성으로 들으면 좋겠다! 는 생각을 하여</span></b><br>3. 카톡 오픈채팅방을 만듭니다.<br>&#160; &#160;(나혼자만 사용하는 &#39;독서&#39; 오픈채팅방^^)<br>4. 게시글로 저장한 해당 텍스트 전체를 복사합니다.<br>5. 오픈 채팅방에 붙여 넣기 합니다.&#160;<br>6. 아래의 노란색을 터치합니다.<br>7. 헤드폰을 누릅니다.<br>8. 책을 음성으로 읽어주기 시작합니다!&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a6e2177449c66778a16085f9410722d9e4db8836\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"626\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a6e2177449c66778a16085f9410722d9e4db8836\" data-origin-width=\"744\" data-origin-height=\"525\"></div><p>무료로 사용하는<br>나만의 오디오북 입니다~<br>&#160;<br>운전하면서<br>듣기 좋습니다~<br>&#160;<br>제안 : 이렇게 만든 오디오북을<br>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;오픈채팅방에서 함께 공유하면 어떨까요?</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>해당 게시물을</p><p>영상으로도 만들어보았습니다~</p><p>(이 영상의 활용가치는?)</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv0scltecu2cjgxo1e8s1vpts@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"300\" data-video-height=\"169\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rv0scltecu2cjgxo1e8s1vpts/thumbs/5.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33289165826&amp;signature=hfNmPCp%2BPF8p%2FVaUko3V1aHTkGU%3D&amp;ts=1732257026\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv0scltecu2cjgxo1e8s1vpts?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2MHNjbHRlY3UyY2pneG8xZThzMXZwdHMiLCJ0aWQiOiIzOGNjZjBiMy1iNTRkLTQ1ZjMtYjNlNC0zYWY0Nzk5MzcxNWQiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODg2Nzh9.reR14Qeu575ybE9NeAOzzg25VEScRH1LjmEE325btanFdy1MNJRjm_6-Bbaoz9Q1rYtwfZ6hzKDsGom8Ih6lPw&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"fig